<title>UK: France Telecom sets 3.0 bln French franc bond.</title>
<headline>France Telecom sets 3.0 bln French franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was announced by joint lead managers BNP and Credit Agricole Indosuez.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FRANCE TELECOM</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.70	MATURITY    25.JUL.10</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.376   PAY DATE    25.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.30	REOFFER    99.426    SPREAD	+13 BP</p>
</text>
